2. Original content: all rights reserved
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The guide's text (milestones, tips, explanations, Confidence and Sources
wording), the selection and arrangement of the data in data/ and in the data
block generated from it into src/index.html, the project's name and
branding, and the project's own artwork (public/favicon.svg, public/icons/) are
(c) 2026 hackthemeatball, all rights reserved. No license is granted for them.

Game facts themselves (levels, costs, rewards, unlock gates, which quest
follows which) belong to no one and are free for anyone to use. This
reservation covers our wording, selection and arrangement, not the facts.

