3. Third-party material (not ours to license)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

AION 2 / NC. AION and AION 2 are trademarks of NC Corporation (formerly
NCSOFT). AION 2's class, skill, stigma, item, place and quest names are used
only to identify in-game content. The skill, stigma and item icons in
src/assets/icons/ are (c) NC Corporation and are not covered by this file; they
are used in a free, unofficial fan guide. This project is not affiliated with
or endorsed by NCSoft (NC Corporation) or NC America.

Fonts. The web fonts in src/assets/fonts/ (Marcellus SC, Figtree, JetBrains
Mono) are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 by their authors, not
under this file. Their license texts (OFL-*.txt, with each font's copyright
notice) ship next to the font files and are served with them.

Data sources. Game facts were compiled from public pages, each credited with a
plain link in the app's Sources card and in data/DATA_SOURCES.md. Metabot
(metabot.gg) is the main source and is credited with a plain (dofollow) link
to each page, as its terms require. Listing a source does not mean it endorses
this project.

Quotations. data/claims.json contains short quotations from source pages,
kept to document why each claim was accepted. Each quotation remains its
owner's and links to its page. Quotations from thegameswiki.com are (c)
thegameswiki contributors, licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/); we shortened them
(marked "..."). They may be reused only under that license.

